      "@type": "NameVariant",
      "fullName": "Ministry of Defence of the Russian Federation, including the Armed Forces of Russia and all operating units wherever located. This includes the national armed services (army, navy, marine, air force, or coast guard), as well as the national guard and national police, government intelligence or reconnaissance organizations of the Russian Federation.",
